ntu tree"},{"surface":"அலம்வரும்","parts":[{"text":"அலம்","lemma":"alam","gloss":"swaying"},{"text":"வரும்","lemma":"varum","gloss":"comes/does"}],"gloss":"sways"},{"surface":"பெருந்தண்","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தண்","lemma":"பெருந்தண்","gloss":"great cool"}],"gloss":"great cool","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காலையும்","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"kālai","gloss":"season/time"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/and"}],"gloss":"even in this season"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கார்","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"kār","gloss":"rainy season"}],"gloss":"the rainy season"},{"surface":"அன்று","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"aṉṟu","gloss":"it is not"}],"gloss":"it is not"},{"surface":"என்றி","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"to say"},{"text":"தி","lemma":"ti","gloss":"second person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"you say"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கனவோ","parts":[{"text":"கனவு","lemma":"kaṉavu","gloss":"dream"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"is it a dream?"},{"surface":"மற்று","parts":[{"text":"மற்று","lemma":"maṟṟu","gloss":"indeed/expletive"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"இது","parts":[{"text":"இது","lemma":"itu","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"வினவுவல்","parts":[{"text":"வினவு","lemma":"viṉavu","gloss":"to ask"},{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"first person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"I ask"},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"yāṉ","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I myself"}]}],"literal":"Beloved children's small feet adorned / frog-mouthed gold-made tinkling anklets, / like gold coins, yielding buds, the cassia / along with the kuruntu tree sways in this great cool season; / \"It is not the rainy season,\" if you say so, / is this a dream? Indeed, this I ask!","translation":"The cassia tree, yielding buds like the gold coins of the frog-mouthed anklets that adorn the small feet of beloved children, sways along with the kuruntu tree in this great, cool season. If you tell me, 'This is not the rainy season,' then I ask you: is this a dream?","modern":"செல்வக் குழந்தைகளின் சிறிய கால்களில் அழகு தரும் தவளை வாய் போன்ற பொன்னால் செய்த கிண்கிணி என்னும் சதங்கையின் காசுகளைப் போல, அரும்புகளைத் தரும் கொன்றை மரம் குருந்த மரத்துடன் சேர்ந்து அசையும் இப்பெரிய குளிர்ந்த காலத்தைக் 'கார் காலம் இல்லை' என்று நீ சொல்வாயானால், நான் கேட்கிறேன், இது கனவா?","explanation":"The heroine (talaivi) is speaking to her companion (tōḻi) who is trying to console her. The hero had promised to return by the onset of the rainy season, which has clearly arrived as the konrai (cassia) and kuruntu trees are in full bloom. To prevent the heroine from slipping into despair, her companion tries to convince her that the rainy season has not yet begun. The heroine points to the blossoming landscape and asks if what she sees is merely a dream, since the physical evidence of the season is undeniable. The golden buds of the konrai tree are beautifully compared to the small gold coins on the frog-mouthed anklets worn by beloved children. This poem belongs to the mullai tiṇai, which deals with the heroine's patient waiting during the rainy season.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.2],[2.2,2.4],[2.4,2.9],[2.9,3.85],[3.85,4.6],[4.6,4.7],[4.7,5.3],[5.3,5.4],[5.4,6.64],[6.64,7.3],[7.3,7.9],[7.9,8.0],[8.0,8.67],[8.89,9.11],[9.11,10.0],[10.0,10.8],[10.8,11.0],[11.0,11.9],[11.9,12.12]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,4.13],[4.13,4.13],[4.13,4.13],[4.13,4.13],[4.13,5.8],[5.8,5.8],[5.8,7.2],[7.2,7.8],[7.8,7.9],[7.9,8.62],[8.87,9.11],[9.11,10.8],[10.8,10.8],[10.8,11.2],[11.2,11.2],[11.2,12.3]]}}